WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:11.867
You've seen this reel. Some genius on Instagram says: this GitHub repo will change your life. Comment REPO, and I'll send you the link.

2
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:21.167
So you comment REPO. And you wait. And you wait. Three days later, still no link.

3
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:27.633
Meet RepoReel. Every repo those reels keep teasing, found for you.

4
00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:34.700
Just ask, in plain words. Like: remove ads from my smart TV.

5
00:00:35.233 --> 00:00:41.667
Boom. The exact reel that answers it, playing right there in the phone.

6
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:49.600
And the repo it was hiding. No comment. No DM. One tap.

7
00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:55.667
Read what it does, how healthy it is, and how fast it's growing.

8
00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:59.400
Like it? Just use it.

9
00:00:59.933 --> 00:01:08.067
Only got a screenshot? Drop it in. RepoReel reads the repo name, right in your browser.

10
00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:16.333
And every night, a pipeline hunts down new English repo reels, and spots the repos about to blow up.

11
00:01:16.867 --> 00:01:25.967
RepoReel. Ask the question. Get the reel. Get the repo. Built by Aditya Malviya.
